; Audited against data/effects.txt TEXT, lines 2045-2070; corrected locally.
; Activate from Spell/Trap Zone; equip a face-up opponent monster. Native
; CONTROL moves it to this controller field; STATE_CHANGED (139) restores
; its former controller when the link or face-up equipment leaves. Storage
; must allocate a legal monster slot for CONTROL, or report failure.
; Only face-up on-field Archfiend cards satisfy the maintenance condition.
; Self.246 is the last damage turn + 1 (initialize to zero); 800 damage occurs
; only once in each opponent Standby Phase while this card remains face-up.

